  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the work of the Office of the Quartet in water, energy, customs, and fiscal leakeages in the Occupied Palestinian Territories (OPTs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to the work of the Office of the Quartet in water, energy, customs, and fiscal leakeages in the Occupied Palestinian Territories (OPTs) is a component of Supporting Economic Empowerment and  Development in Palestine (SEED) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;2,099,997. It works in the following sector(s): Trade facilitation, Regional trade agreements (RTAs), Energy policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
